sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Customer
  participant W as Web App
  participant O as Order Service
  participant P as Payment Gateway
  U->>W: Click "Pay now"
  W->>O: Create order
  O->>P: Charge card
  alt payment succeeds
    P-->>O: Success
    O-->>W: Order confirmed
    W-->>U: Show receipt
  else payment fails
    P-->>O: Declined
    O-->>W: Payment failed
    W-->>U: Ask for another method
  end
